& [ActivatedBehavior]
  + validate the AnchorQuery derived catalogue and exact matching admitted SemanticFabric before discovery
  + accept only exact_identity exact_label declared_applicability and typed_relation channels
  + gather exact known identities and normalized compiled labels with original bases preserved
  + gate lifecycle read authority purpose use-case context and boundaries before downstream expansion
  + preserve unavailable structured gate facts as unresolved guards and omissions
  + join only exact admitted ApplicabilityBinding records whose declared guards pass
  + traverse only allowed typed relations under deterministic depth cycle and path budgets
  + enforce PriorityLattice stable ordering winning-tier ambiguity and exact address resolution
  + bind proof result digest and continuation to exact request catalogue and fabric identities
  + clip honestly under candidates records paths bytes and continuation budgets

& [MandatoryProof]
  + equal inputs and cursor positions produce byte-identical result bytes and digests
  + exact identity outranks exact label and lower tiers cannot replace it
  + shared label ties remain explicit ambiguity
  + purpose boundary lifecycle and authority faults remain visible without arbitrary address collapse
  + unknown identity term missing declaration and unavailable applicability remain accounted
  + relation direction identity type depth cycle and path basis are inspectable
  + changed roots request or cursor fail closed
  + candidate path byte and continuation clipping is deterministic and root-bound
  + focused tests full workspace tests clippy format evidence manifests and diff gates pass

& [ProhibitedBehavior]
  + lexical substring similarity token weights embeddings model inference learned routing provider prompt or attention bridge
  + scalar score collapse or conversion of relevance into truth confidence risk permission or authority
  + inference of use-case boundary applicability operation capability authority or meaning from prose
  + package compilation signing trust mutation source admission persistence notification network remote hidden state effect FPGA OneDrive EVO-X2 or Minecraft behavior
  + modification of direct query or iterative-attention independent paths

& [Invalidation]
  + any locked source review canonical or prior-proof identity change
  + any scanner behavior outside ActivatedBehavior
  + any candidate lacking exact catalogue and fabric resolution
  + any unaccounted ambiguity exclusion stale unauthorized unresolved clipping path or omission
  + any nondeterministic clock random environment provider or mutable global input

